  ozelFonksiyon: "tarot ge\xE7mi\u015F sohbeti ba\u015Flat"
  aciklama:
  - "Ge\xE7mi\u015Fin i\xE7in \"Ermi\u015F\" kart\u0131n\u0131 \"ters\" se\xE7tin.\n\nSen
    ya bilerek yaln\u0131z kalm\u0131\u015F ya da kas\u0131tl\u0131 olarak yaln\u0131z
    b\u0131rak\u0131lm\u0131\u015Fs\u0131n {{isim}}. Ne sesine do\u011Fru y\xF6nelebilece\u011Fin
    bir insan ne de istikametine uyabilece\u011Fin bir tabela bulabilmi\u015Fsin.
    Hani k\xFC\xE7\xFCk \xE7ocuklar ne yapacaklar\u0131n\u0131 bilemeyip \xFCz\xFCld\xFCklerinde
    olduklar\u0131 yere \xE7\xF6melir kal\u0131r ya, sen de \xF6ylece kalakalm\u0131\u015Fs\u0131n.
    Baz\u0131 insanlar\u0131n a\xE7t\u0131\u011F\u0131 bo\u015Flu\u011Fu ba\u015Fka
    birileri ya da farkl\u0131 bir \u015Feylerle kapatmaya \xE7al\u0131\u015Fmak
    ise senin \xF6nemli bir hatan olmu\u015F. De\u011Ferli \u015Feylerin ikamesinin
    kolayl\u0131kla yap\u0131lamayaca\u011F\u0131n\u0131 ve belki de buna u\u011Fra\u015Fman\u0131n
    gerekli dahi olmad\u0131\u011F\u0131n\u0131 \xE7ok sonralar\u0131 anlam\u0131\u015Fs\u0131n."
